
"smart_sources:00_00 - Kickstarter - NELL SHIPMAN_GIRL FROM GOD'S COUNTRY FILM.md": {"path":"00_00 - Kickstarter - NELL SHIPMAN_GIRL FROM GOD'S COUNTRY FILM.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"p45a5r","at":1785794996639},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1784666887576,"size":20993,"at":1785794996922,"hash":"p45a5r"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,6],"###$26,360":[7,8],"###131":[9,12],"###131#{1}":[11,12],"##Story":[13,14],"##HELLO KICKSTARTERS! MIRACLE OR MIRACLES--WE ARE OVER 19K BUT WEHAVE less THAN 24 HOURS TO MAKE OUR GOAL OR LOOSE EVERYTHING PLEDGED TO DATE!! WE NEED YOUR HELP!! PLEASE PLEDGE WHAT YOU CAN!!":[15,16],"##NELL'S STORY HAS BEEN LOST FOR NEARLY 100 YEARS--HELP US GIVE THIS INCREDIBLE FILM PIONEER AND ANIMAL RIGHTS ACTIVIST THE RECOGNITION SHE DESERVES!":[17,20],"##NELL'S STORY HAS BEEN LOST FOR NEARLY 100 YEARS--HELP US GIVE THIS INCREDIBLE FILM PIONEER AND ANIMAL RIGHTS ACTIVIST THE RECOGNITION SHE DESERVES!#{1}":[19,20],"##DOES ANGELINA JOLIE KNOW NELL SHIPMAN WAS THE FIRST ACTION-ADVENTURE HEROINE IN FILM...?":[21,24],"##DOES ANGELINA JOLIE KNOW NELL SHIPMAN WAS THE FIRST ACTION-ADVENTURE HEROINE IN FILM...?#{1}":[23,24],"##She Vanished....":[25,32],"##She Vanished....#{1}":[27,32],"##Watch this extended trailer to learn more about Nell's life and her disappearance...":[33,38],"##Watch this extended trailer to learn more about Nell's life and her disappearance...#{1}":[35,38],"##There is much more to this story than what you see here... and that's why we need your help to finish this film!":[39,42],"##There is much more to this story than what you see here... and that's why we need your help to finish this film!#{1}":[41,42],"##That's where our film begins...":[43,58],"##That's where our film begins...#{1}":[45,58],"##Nell paid for these freedoms by losing everything.":[59,62],"##Nell paid for these freedoms by losing everything.#{1}":[61,62],"##How did an entire generation of Nell's female film contemporaries disappear?":[63,72],"##How did an entire generation of Nell's female film contemporaries disappear?#{1}":[65,72],"##The role of independent filmmakers in Hollywood will undoubtedly continue to expand, but few today realize the price Nell Shipman and her generation of female film pioneers paid forging their path.":[73,78],"##The role of independent filmmakers in Hollywood will undoubtedly continue to expand, but few today realize the price Nell Shipman and her generation of female film pioneers paid forging their path.#{1}":[75,78],"##Finally, in our film, GIRL FROM GOD'S COUNTRY, Nell Shipman will deservedly be seen as a star among great stars –a role she has played silently for too long.":[79,80],"##BE A FRIEND OF NELL! HELP US BRING NELL'S STORY TO THE BIG SCREEN! THANKS FOR YOUR SUPPORT!":[81,82],"##And Don't Forget Your REWARDS!!":[83,94],"##And Don't Forget Your REWARDS!!#{1}":[85,94],"##THIS IS YOUR DIRECTOR SPEAKING:":[95,106],"##THIS IS YOUR DIRECTOR SPEAKING:#{1}":[97,106],"##NELL SHIPMAN:":[107,108],"##GIRL FROM GOD'S COUNTRY":[109,120],"##GIRL FROM GOD'S COUNTRY#{1}":[111,120],"##Risks and challenges":[121,260],"##Risks and challenges#{1}":[123,130],"##Risks and challenges#All gone":[131,133],"##Risks and challenges#All gone#{1}":[133,133],"##Risks and challenges#Backers":[134,135],"##Risks and challenges#Backers#{1}":[135,135],"##Risks and challenges#Estimated delivery":[136,140],"##Risks and challenges#Estimated delivery#{1}":[137,139],"##Risks and challenges#Estimated delivery#{2}":[145,149],"##Risks and challenges#Backers#{2}":[141,142],"##Risks and challenges#Backers#{2}#{1}":[142,142],"##Risks and challenges#Ships to":[143,144],"##Risks and challenges#Ships to#{1}":[144,144],"##Risks and challenges#Estimated delivery#{2}#{1}":[146,148],"##Risks and challenges#Estimated delivery#{2}#{2}":[149,149],"##Risks and challenges#Backers#{3}":[150,151],"##Risks and challenges#Backers#{3}#{1}":[151,151],"##Risks and challenges#Ships to#{2}":[15